"``Tools/scripts/var_access_benchmark.py``. The benchmark script displays "
"timings in nanoseconds.  The benchmarks were measured on an `Intel® Core™ "
"i7-4960HQ processor <https://ark.intel.com/content/www/us/en/ark/"
